window.products.push({"id":333095,"name":"Bamboo Cheese Board 12 x 8 Inch – 100% Natural Wood Serving Platter Set with 4 Knife and Utensils – Perfect Housewarming, Wedding Gift.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812ApeIaQ1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"On our cheese board you can cut and serve a variety of soft and hard cheeses or tasty appetizers. On the bottom draw you’ll find a concealed tray which slides out smoothly to reveal four specialist cheese tools. Perfect centerpiece for parties and entertaining ECO FRENDLY Bamboo is well known to naturally replenish itself, making each of these cutting boards environmentally friendly, quality kitchen essential. How to proper maintain a bamboo cutting board to last for years and look like new: 1. Wash your cutting board with soap and water , after washing dry immediately with a towel and let it air dry. 2. Oil your chopping board. You can use walnut or coconut oil. Pour the oil onto your dry cutting board and rub in a circular with a clean cloth. Make sure to oil all sides. Oil your board regularly a specially when you feel your board is dry to keep up the shine and water-proofing. 3. If your board has stains or smells, you can u se lemon juice or white vinegar directly on the area. The acid in these liquids will neutralize the organic material or fats causing the problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812ApeIaQ1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Reaowazo","source_asin":"B07PVCFZZP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-333095","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PVCFZZP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PVCFZZP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
