window.products.push({"id":333105,"name":"WUWEOT 3.4 Quart Tea Kettle For Stove Top, Whistling Teapot with Wood Handle, Stainless Steel White Pumpkin Shape Kettle-Surgical, Anti-hot Handle, An","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715WAwgS2lS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You can hear loud automatic whistle as soon as the water starts boiling, even in a noisy environment. The whistle on this kettle will grab your attention while you are focused on housework, movies or games at the same time. Prevent you from forgetting to turn it off and drying the water up. Our stovetop teapot is made of 5 layer food-grade finish and high quality stainless steel, durable, rust and corrosion resistant, do not fade and easy to clean. Provides a fast-heat in no time to enjoy your morning tea or coffee time.Easy to maintain and anti-rust scratches for daily use as well. WUWEOT tea kettle with the grip-open design makes it more convenient to open the spout, avoiding heating damage from steam. You can handle it with one hand, the spout can stay open until you close it by your thumb pressing it. Wood handle ensures non-slip and safe to pour water. This tea kettle is designed with a generous 8 inch base that maximizes heat conduction. Wide bottom makes boiling faster, seal lid increase the efficiency of boiling. Suitable for all type of cookers, such as magnetic induction, gas, natural gas stovetop and radiant stoves, electric ceramic heater, induction cooker, halogen stove. Large capacity of 3.4 quart is perfect for serving in a whole family or party. You don't need to repeatedly boil water and saving you time. Easy to clean, the big cap hole makes you can put your hand into the stainless steel teapot to wash it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715WAwgS2lS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WUWEOT","source_asin":"B09164DLC9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-333105","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09164DLC9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09164DLC9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
