window.products.push({"id":333123,"name":"DULLEMELO Storage Cubes 11x11x11, Storage Bins for Cube Organizer for Closet, Storage Cubes for Organizing Clothes Toys Books, Fabric Cube Storage Bin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tiZVIk02L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅Size: We have prepared 3 sizes storage boxes for you to meet the different sizes of shelf and closet in your home. The 11 inch cube storage bin is perfect for storing toys, books, magazines, blankets, towels, office documents and anything else you need to storage. Of course, if you think the storage cubes 11x11x11 can not meet your needs, we also prepared 12 inch storage bins and 13x13x13 storage cube bins for you to choose from. Meeting your needs has always been our goal. ✅Colorful colors: At DULLEMELO, nothing is more important than your satisfaction. This time, we have prepared a variety of colors for you to choose, including versatile neutral colors and lively colors suitable for summer. Whether it is in formal occasions or home office, our collapsible storage bins can well meet various scenarios. Decorative storage boxes will be your best choice. ✅Material: You will feel excellent when you receive our organization bins. Because it is consist of high-quality fabric material, comfortable linen lining, easy-to-pull metal handles, and a sturdy cardbroad. The appearance not only looks very sturdy and beautiful, and at the same time, it is not easy to deform and produce folds. ✅Multifunctional: Storage is a particularly fulfilling thing, and the 4 pcs cube storage bins can meet your various storage needs. These fabric storage cubes can be used not only in your home but also in the office. At home, you can store toys, pet supplies and blankets. In the office, you can use these cube organizer bins to store documents, books, folders, office supplies. ✅FOLDABLE DESIGN: When you receive our storage box, it is a very space-saving folded state. Just pull it apart with the metal handle gently, put in a sturdy cardboard and you're good to go. Very user-friendly design, when you don't need to use it, you can fold it to save space. There may be a little creases on the sides of the storage box, but this does not affect the use, just need to be lightly ironed with an ironing machine to remove the crease.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tiZVIk02L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DULLEMELO","source_asin":"B0BFDTFW7F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-333123","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFDTFW7F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFDTFW7F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
