window.products.push({"id":333133,"name":"HOME-X Set of 3 Cake Pans, Nonstick Metal Cake Molds and Baking Set, Square, Heart, Round Cake Pans-Springform Release-Easy Baking","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aRgHA-LEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add some flair to your baking by using the HOME-X Set of 3 Cake Pans with round, square, and heart-shaped pans. It's perfect for cakes, pies, and even casseroles for special occasions or any day of the week. Each baking dish comes with a springform ring that easily releases so you won't have to worry about pulling your cakes out in pieces. For recipes such as cheesecakes, tortes, and sponge cakes that aren't able to be inverted, it allows you to create decadent desserts with beautiful clean edges fit for a bakery. The pans are nonstick and made with durable carbon steel for strong bakeware that can hold up to repeated use. The pans are made without PFOA and can withstand temperatures up to 500° F so you can try out adventurous recipes. When the pans aren't being used for sweet treats, they can be used to bake your favorite homemade meals such as casseroles, mac n’ cheese, shepherd’s pie, and more.The set comes with pans measuring 10\", 9 1/2\", and 8 1/2\" in diameter so you have a variety of shapes and sizes to fit your preference. The nonstick surface makes cleaning up easy—simply hand wash with soap and warm water. The bakeware set also makes a great universal gift, so it's perfect for the friend or family member that's difficult to shop for. Pair it with fancy baking tools for the avid baker or with brownie mixes and frosting for the hobby baker or home cook. Whether the HOME-X Set of 3 Cake Pans is used in your own kitchen or gifted to someone else, we know it'll add some fun to your baking while providing the performance you need.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aRgHA-LEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B08J4F2RB8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-333133","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J4F2RB8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J4F2RB8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
