window.products.push({"id":333210,"name":"HeyDreamy Embroidery 3 Piece Duvet Cover Set Ultra Soft Cotton Slub Yarn Pre-Washed Comforter Cover with Leaf Pattern Hidden Zipper Closure (Purple,Fu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aGz5egMyL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Invite the Beauty of Texture to Your Bedroom Sleep in dreamy serenity with this HeyDreamy’s 3 piece bedding set. Featuring delicate leaf embroidery against soft cotton slub, this duvet cover set brings an understated elegance and beauty to your space. Complete with two simply stunning matching pillow shams, this bedding set instantly boosts a crisp dimension for a fresh yet lavish look. Pre-Washed, Ultra Soft Cotton Slub Designed for maximum comfort and absorbency, the bedding set is is woven from ultra soft and breathable pre-washed cotton slub yarn. To guarantee optimal quality, the bed set is made by OEKO-TEX certified factory for high safety and environmental standards. Easy Care: Machine Washable and Dryer Friendly The bedding set is easy to care for. Machine wash in cold water on gentle cycle. Wash dark colors separately. Use only non-chlorine bleach when needed. Tumble dry on low heat. Iron on low heat if needed. . Free Gift: Each HeyDreamy purchase comes with a complimentary dreamcatcher (while supplies last). To avoid danger of suffocation, keep the plastic bag away from infants and children. Do not use the bag in cribs, beds, carriages, or play pens. This bag is not a toy. CHOKING HAZARD - Not for children under 3 years. Use with adult supervision. About HeyDreamy HeyDreamy began with a simple philosophy that every day is an opportunity to follow your dreams and enjoy life. By going direct-to-consumer, HeyDreamy is able to weave style and comfort into every room of the home at an exceptional value. As an award winning manufacturer of many global prestigious bedding brands, HeyDreamy cares deeply about the impact our business has on local communities and the environment. All of HeyDreamy collections are crafted with care through eco-friendly techniques and sustainable practices.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aGz5egMyL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HeyDreamy","source_asin":"B07NNTJ8V8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-333210","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NNTJ8V8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NNTJ8V8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
