window.products.push({"id":333257,"name":"Pack of 3 Green Concept's Reusable Shopping Grocery Tote Bag - Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/416WNM4RIBL._AC_.jpg","description":"Did you know that over 1 million plastic bags are being consumed every minute? Some of the plastic bags will end up in our landfills and eventually break down into tiny toxic bits polluting our soil, river, lakes and oceans. If get disposed improperly, these plastic bags will be harmful to our widelife. For example, over 100,000 birds, seals, turtles and whales are killed by plastic rubbish every year. Help saving the environment by purchasing the Green Concept's reusable tote bags. Our tote bags are great alternatives to plastic bags. For each reusable bag you buy, you help to eliminate hundreds of plastic bags. Green Concept is an eco friendly manufacturer that produces stylish and reusable tote bags. All of our bags are easy to clean, durable and 100% recyclable. Take action and save our world - get a Green Concept's bag today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/416WNM4RIBL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Concept Green","source_asin":"B0012VNFHQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-333257","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0012VNFHQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0012VNFHQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
