window.products.push({"id":333275,"name":"ARELUX Color Powder 12 Pack, 8 Colors Holi Powder in 70g Bags,with A Portable Drawstring Bag,Ideal Packets for Color Run, Marathon Race Events,Gender ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Vv8ABg6zL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"More Color - Choose us ,you gonna receive Pink*2, Blue*2,Green*2,Yellow*2,Red*1,Purple*1, Rose red*1, Orange*1.70g each bag,total 840g/1.85lb. Easy Clean - Just shake and blow off color from hair, skin and clothes while it`s dry then cleans up easily with a little soap and water.For hard surfaces like driveways and parking lots just sweep dry color, followed by a good rinse with water. Easy Carry - Each set has 12 pack little bag Color Powder.The bag is not easy to break and more portable.You can throw these directly from an open bag ,pour into your hands or pour into a simple condiment bottle and squeeze. Safe & Harmless - Made with 100% edible cornstarch, it's safe to touch the skin and hair.If you accidentally get into your eyes, rinse with water. Colorful Memory - Engaging Fun to Events by our color powder.Enough amount for Color Fights, Small Fun Runs,Backyard Parties, Holi Festivals, photo shoot, color war and more. Go create some of your most memorable pictures now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Vv8ABg6zL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARELUX","source_asin":"B083WS7993","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-333275","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083WS7993","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083WS7993","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":333276,"name":"Le Creuset Stoneware Syrup Jar, 8 oz., Cerise","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WRFntpqQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A lovely addition to any kitchen collection, this stoneware jar holds up to 6-Ounce of syrup--perfect for pancakes, waffles, French toast, and more. It can even go in the microwave for warming contents before serving. The round-shaped jar, which measures approximately 2-2/3 by 3 by 3-8/9 inches, comes with a gently curved side handle, a smooth-flowing spout for pouring, and classic decoration on the exterior, including a distinctive embossed maple leaf and Le Creuset's signature concentric rings. Le Creuset's line of stoneware features a hard-wearing, impermeable finish fired at temperatures as high as 2192 degrees F. With a porosity level of less than 1 percent, it blocks moisture absorption, which can lead to cracking, crazing, and rippling along the interior. Its non-porous construction also resists odors, scratching, and staining for hygienic use and optimal performance. Even more, its high-quality enamel protects against metal marks and other damage, which means it's safe to use with knives. Best of all, the glaze on the exterior makes the stoneware items fun to mix and match with other coordinating Le Creuset pieces (sold separately), while a neutral-colored glaze on the inside offers an optimal palette for food presentation. And thanks to an unmatched thermal resistance from -65 degrees F to 500 degrees F, Le Creuset stoneware moves effortlessly from the microwave or oven (or under the broiler) to the table for serving to the refrigerator or freezer for storing leftovers. When finished, it cleans up easily by hand or in the dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WRFntpqQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Creuset","source_asin":"B003F24CYU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-333276","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003F24CYU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003F24CYU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
