window.products.push({"id":333314,"name":"OPUX Premium Insulated Lunch Box for Men, Women | School Lunch Bag for Boys, Girls, Kids | Compact Adult Lunch Pail Work Office Cooler | Soft, Leakpro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Q9utEN2zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect for bringing food/snacks to school, and for adult men and women to bring lunch to the office/job or on the go. The ideal reusable small lunch tote with ample room for meals, snacks, and beverages! MULTIPLE WAYS TO CARRY Convenient TWO-handle design: one handle to carry the lunch box horizontally (to avoid spilling soups and beverages); another to carry vertically. A shoulder strap is also included to carry the lunch pail on your shoulder or across your body. Thats FOUR versatile ways to to use this lunch bag depending on your needs. FUNCTIONAL DESIGN Equipped with soft eco-friendly PVC-free PEVA lining that is easy to clean. Just wipe with a wet cloth and it's good as new! Spacious enough to fit 6 cans of soda, or one persons lunch and more! Exterior zippered pocket and interior net pouch allow for storing extra items, such as utensils, napkins, phone, and more snacks. QUALITY AND DURABLE CONSTRUCTION Made with high-quality 600D polyester fabric on the outside and soft, smooth nylon interior lining. Equipped with large reinforced zippers to ensure maximum durability while opening and closing the lunch bag. Measures 10 x 8 x 5.5; Stores up to 12 cans; Available in 7 colors , Passed CPSIA Lead, CSPA Phthalates & Cadmium Test - Manufacturer recommended age: Ages 3+","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Q9utEN2zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"opux","source_asin":"B09C6JFG1P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-333314","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C6JFG1P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C6JFG1P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
