window.products.push({"id":333488,"name":"The Bishop Cotton California King Size Bed Sheets 800 Thread Count Soft 100% Egyptian Cotton Breathable Bed Set 4 Pieces Italian Finish Premium Long S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RieP+-xXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"♥ Welcome to the World of Luxurious Sheets in soft sateen and durable long-staple Cotton. _ We at The Bishop Cotton™ Believe in happy customers and best customer services Possible. _ Our 100% Egyptian Cotton 800 Thread Count Sheets Sets are the true definition of luxury and comfort. _ Why is Egyptian cotton so much better for your sheets? Quite simply, Egyptian cotton produces longer fibers (up to twice as long as a standard cotton fiber). The longer fibers or staples are easily spun into finer count yarns and turned into the softest sheets you will ever sleep on. It's that simple! \"\"Ply\"\" refers to the number of yarns wrapped together in a single thread. The process of plying creates thicker threads, which will impact a sheet's feel and durability. Finer threads allow for higher thread counts resulting in a softer sheet with an elegant drape. Our Single ply sheets use individual, un-plied threads in the weaving process, resulting in lightweight fabric with exceptional drape and softness. Make your bed more beautiful and comfortable than ever with the 1000 Thread Count 100% Egyptian Cotton Luxury Sheet Set! You won't find luxury at this price anywhere else! _ We are excited to bring you luxury in the endeavor to make your overall health the best it can be. Our Egyptian Cotton has a feeling of relaxation, peace, luxury and comfort within its threads. Here's to peaceful, ultimate Sleep.Click on \"\"Add to Cart\"\" and enjoy the luxuriousness of The Bishop Cotton™ ♥","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RieP+-xXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Bishop Cotton","source_asin":"B0C4TY4ZRQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-333488","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4TY4ZRQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4TY4ZRQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
