window.products.push({"id":333552,"name":"Glideaway 6A Bed Frame Fast'n up Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+1uTF7AKL._AC_.jpg","description":"Works with the following sizes: Twin, Full, Queen Installation of 6A Bed Fast'n Up Bed Kit by Glideaway Assemble bed frame to correct width of mattress set. There is a left and a Right Fast'n Up Bracket. Bolt brackets to bed frame (Do not tighten them securely yet) using horizontal slots. Place headboard firmly down on brackets. Now tighten bolts. Wood screws may be used to secure brackets to headboard legs. Fits nearly all Twin, full, And Queen headboards having a rail slot in built into the legs. Attach brackets to frame with hooks pointing up. We have this illustrated in the directions photo. Hooks fit under steel pins in legs to lift and carry light weight headboards off the floor. When assembled correctly the headboard should float off floor slightly. If legs of headboard drag on the floor this is because pin setting in legs are set too high. You will need to determine which horizontal slot in the Fasten Up Bed Kit Bracket the bed frame should be bolted to in order to lift the headboard slightly off the floor. NOTE 1: If your headboard is larger and heavier you will want to choose our Down Hooks as a better choice for conversion.  NOTE 2: Queen Installation For Queen size (60\") Bedding Open frame to 60\" and install brackets as shown in Fig. E in directions photo. Brackets will fit into the rail slit at the full size position and will extend outward from the legs. More Steel Bed Frames Accessory Parts Download the installation instructions","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+1uTF7AKL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glideaway","source_asin":"B009M2U8BI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-333552","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009M2U8BI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009M2U8BI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":333553,"name":"THE LOOMIA Turkish Towel – Turqueen Artisan Handwoven Series (Linen Cotton, Size Extra Large, Beige)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8105fUoITiL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"We would like to call this elegant Turkish towel Turqueen No: 32. A beautiful turquoise striped super light linen-cotton towel. Place of Use: This is the perfect item as an elegant towel, shawl, throw, blanket or even baby blanket. For Whom: For experienced peshtemal towel users who love the elegant and simple look at home, beach, pool or yachting. Colors: A natural cream linen base with black, blue, grey and turquoise stripes. Feel of Touch: A natural and bold linen feel. Fabric: 50% Linen and 50% Turkish Cotton Weight: Super Lightweight 9.2 oz Dimensions: XL Towel 37 X 72 inches Take it anywhere you like. It is compact (takes minimum space in your bag), light, fast absorbing, and quick drying. All hand-loomed Turkish towels can be a little bit different in size, weight, and color. They can also have wrinkles and tiny blemishes which makes them naturally perfect and unique. We love our vertical stripes in our towels, reaching from top to bottom and forming beautiful tassel styles. Please wash your Peshtemal Turkish towels at a cold temperature. We recommend that you hang dry the towels. Never use bleach or fabric softener on your hand-loomed textiles. If ironing your Turkish Towels, we recommend no more than a warm setting. Do not dry clean. Your towel is made of raw cotton. It is very natural if it shrinks a little. By following these instructions, your sheets will become softer, more absorbent, stronger and will last longer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8105fUoITiL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THE LOOMIA","source_asin":"B07D75ZD1K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-333553","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D75ZD1K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D75ZD1K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
