window.products.push({"id":333637,"name":"ManMengJi Round Fitted Tablecloth 2 Pack, Champagne Round Tablecloth with Elastic Edged, Waterproof Wipe Clean Table Cover for Outdoor/Indoor Use, Fit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HOMZMX7QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DOUBLE ELASTIC FITTED DESIGN - The round fitted tablecloth is designed to have a snug fitting to the table just like the second skin, edge elastic band design replaces flimsy tape and clips for a complete fit. No shifting, no sliding, and you will feel neat, clean, relaxed and free in a meal or game, especially suitable for families with active children. Each package includes 2 Pack tablecloths for your more demanding needs. WIPEABLE AND REVERSIBLE - The elastic round tablecloth is made of 90% polyester and 10% spandex, upgraded with waterproof coating technology. It is wipeable and oil proof. Liquids like coffee, juice, wine or kinds of sauce, just clean it with a damp cloth. It is also reversible and can be used on both sides. The other side is uncoated, waterproof but not oil-resistant. The two sides are usually not the same color, offering a variety of possibilities for your desktop decor. ANTI-TEAR AND HEAT RESISTANT - ManMengJi round fifted tablecloth is more durable and wear-resistant than ordinary cloth. Even in cold winter, it won’t become stiff or fragile like vinyl. And the round fitted tablecloth touches soft and has good texture, no odor and will bring you good experience. The round fitted tablecloth has certain heat resistance (up to 90 ℃). In this way, general hot drinks and food can be directly placed on it. With it you will save a lot of trouble. CLASSIC TABLE COVER DIMENSION - This table covers suitable for standard round table. Best fits round tables up to 32\"-36\" diameter (4 seats); 40\"-44\" diameter (6 seats); 45\"-59\" diameter (8 seats); Only one person can put in place quickly and easily. Easy to care, wipes clean with a damp cloth (recommended), Machine washable, Do not bleach and iron. SUITABLE FOR INDOOR OUTDOOR ACTIVITIES - This round elastic tablecloth is perfect for everyday use such as dining table, card table, picnics, banquet, coffee table, BBQs, garden lounging, beach, parks. Whether it is used to cover the old table, protect the table, or change the color, it will be your right choice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HOMZMX7QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ManMengJi","source_asin":"B0BM4844FB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-333637","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM4844FB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM4844FB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
