window.products.push({"id":333815,"name":"Reusable Storage Bags,10 Pack Reusable Food Container Bags Sets BPA Free Freezer Bags,2 Food Storage Gallon Bags,4 Leakproof Sandwich Bags and 4 Kids ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ub-+RkQ1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FOOD GRADE MATERIAL & REUSABLE: Made of food grade PEVA materials,our reusable storage bags do not contain PVC,BPA,chloride and lead,and there are no harmful chemicals.You and your family can safely store food and personal belongings. LEAKPROOF & EASY SEAL:Double-zipper sealing lock adopted by the reusable freezing bag can not only avoid the overflow of liquid,but also prevent the mixing of the smell of different foods.It is more convenient to classify and store different foods and keep the refrigerator clean.The anti-skid zipper design allows children to easily open and close them. FREEZE SAFE & EASY TO CLEAN:Reusable storage bag is strong and durable,which can prevent your food from being frozen and burned,while maintaining the freshness and taste of food.It is very suitable for freezing different kinds of meat,fruits and vegetables.In order to insure longer life, please clean with hand or bottle brush with soap and water then put it on top of a mug or cup to air dry.They are easy to fold and store to reduce the space required. Perfect for kitchen, picnics and travel. MULTI PURPOSE:We provide three different sizes of storage bags,2 reusable gallon bags (11x10.6 inches),4 reusable sandwich bags (8.5x7.1 inches) and 4 reusable snack bags (8.5x4.7 inches),which can be used for a variety of storage methods,such as food,cosmetics,stationery,Travel Toiletries, jewelry, etc and the density of PEVA material is between 0.91 and 0.93,so the weight is very light and easy to carry. Biodegradable:If it is not needed,whether it is thrown away or burned,it is environmentally friendly and will not cause any harm to the environment.Each reusable freezer bag is reusable for hundreds of times,Saving up to 350+ disposable plastic bags,Reducing waste & pollution and saving lots of marine creatures.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ub-+RkQ1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jarjetonta","source_asin":"B09Y8QVJ1H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-333815","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y8QVJ1H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y8QVJ1H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
