window.products.push({"id":333918,"name":"Black Boho Stripes Cushioned Anti-Fatigue Kitchen Mats and Rugs,Absorbent Floor Bath Door Mat Non-Slip Doormat Accent Runner Carpet Indoor Comfort Sta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.15,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S1e1KdrKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Have You Ever Suffered Back Aches Caused By Your Uncomfortable Posture While Washing Dishes, Cooking, Doing Laundry Or Working? Now, The Back Aches Will Go Away! Why Choose Our Anti-Fatigue Cushioned Kitchen Floor Mat And Runner Set Of 2? * Cushioned Support--The Kitchen Mat Offers Cushioned Support To Your Feet And To Help Relieve Pressure On Feet And Knees. It Is A Must-Have If You Are On Your Feet For Extended Periods (Such As Chef, Hair Sylist, Etc.).* Excellent Absorbance--Absorbs Water Properly, Stops All The Splashing Water/Oil From Leaving Marks On Your Kitchen Ground, Making Your Kitchen Clean And Tidy.*Anti-Slip Backing-- Textured Bottom Makes The Mat Stay In Place And Helps Prevent Your Family From Sliding Around.*Good Quality Fabric-Reduces The Scratches Bought By Knives Or Furniture, Which Helps Protect The Floor Well.* Elegant Design--Decorate Your Kitchen And Home, Bring More Joy And Comfort To Your Cooking Time. Where Can The Mat Be Used? -Anti Fatigue Cushioned Mat For Kitchen-Comfort Mat For Bedroom-Standing Desk Mat For Office-L Shaped Sink Rug For Laundry Room-Luxurious Welcome Doormat For Entryway-Waterproof Bath Rugs For Bathroom-Extra Long Hallway Mats-Indoor Runner Mats-Moderate Thickness Floor Mats [Warm Tip] 1.The Following Tips Are Applicable To All Rugs. Open Rug Fully And Place On Clean, Flat, Dry Floor. Please Note: Water Under Rug May Cause Slippage!!! Rug Must Always Be Placed On Flat Dry Surface During Use.2.For Facilitate Transportation, We Use A Vacuum Compression Method. The Crease Is Unavoidable. After A Gentle Ironing, Press It With A Heavy Object, And The Crease Will Disappear After 1-2 Days.3.The Above Data Is Manually Measured, There Is An Error Of 1-2 Inches.4.The Colors Displayed On Different Monitors Are Slightly Different.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S1e1KdrKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Greday","source_asin":"B09V7LRHWT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-333918","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V7LRHWT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V7LRHWT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":333919,"name":"Matani Bamboo Toothbrush Holder Diatomite Tooth Brush Organizer - Storage for Small Bathroom & Counter, Stand with Removable Bottom & Drainage Holes -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hWJdZfcIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keeps Toothbrush Fully Dry in Between Uses: Made from natural Diatomite & Bamboo, our premium toothbrush stand quickly absorbs water from your toothbrush to keep it dry & clean when not in use! Easy-to-Clean with Removable Bottom: Unlike typical holders that are a pain to clean, our bathroom toothbrush holder has a detachable base that ensures easy cleaning of the cup! Built with holes that drain excess moisture. Stores All Your Oral Care Essentials: Measuring 3 x 3 x 5.11 inches, it can fit 2 toothbrushes & a toothpaste or 2 toothbrushes & an electric toothbrush! Looks Elegant on Any Countertop: Designed to complement any space, our modern toothbrush storage is a great addition to any room! Place it on your bathroom counter, vanity table, kitchen countertop, or even on your desk! Must-Have for Stress-Free Daily Routine: Keep your bathroom organized with our toothbrush toothpaste holder that lets you conveniently reach for your toothbrush! Click 'Add to Cart' now for clutter-free counters! FUNCTIONAL DESIGN: The quality of a toothbrush holder is determined by how quickly it dries off, keeping air flow so no water collects in the toothbrush cup, and how easy it is to clean. Another main advantage are the holes in the bottom of the bamboo which help to avoid mold. Our Bamboo Diatomite Bathroom Toothbrush Holder has small micro ventilation holes for drainage at the bottom. That means 360˚ air circulation in all directions. BIGGER SIZE & MULTI-FUNCTIONAL: We have specially designed a bigger cup so you can store more toothbrushes in each toothbrush holder. Each Diatomite Toothbrush Holder can store at least 5 toothbrushes or 3 toothbrushes and toothpaste. It is really up to you what to store in our Bamboo Diatomite Toothbrush Holder. We have also designed a Bamboo separable bottom to make it easy for you to clean the bottom of your Toothbrush Holder Cup. PREMIUM LOOK: crafted from single piece of Organic Bamboo Wood and Diatomite Minerals our toothbrush holder stands unique. The combination of these two materials are not only functional but will make any interior shine by its subtle, artistic and modern look. Each item is highly polished and carbonized for slightly darker tint and significantly improved water resistance. Our toothbrush holders fit great into your modern bathroom countertop. ECO FRIENDLY: Made from 100% MOSO Bamboo and Natural Diatomite Earth makes it fully biodegradable. We are serious about creating Sustainable products to add an extra value to our customers. SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: We created our tooth brush holders for bathrooms with passion and love for design and for nature. We hope you will love it too. However, if for any reason you don’t, please let us know and we will resolve the issue.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hWJdZfcIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Matani","source_asin":"B08GZGBMTY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-333919","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GZGBMTY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GZGBMTY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
