window.products.push({"id":333943,"name":"Modus Furniture Rath Scroll Platform Bed, King, Ivory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K7gIL4PCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Rath King Scroll Platform Bed's premium bed frame uses a 1-piece headboard that extends all the way to the floor; because of its size this product ships via freight carrier. Platform bed mattress support system consists of 2 steel center rails with 4 steel support legs and 36 wooden slats. Cross slats are bent plywood, which creates a springier, more elastic mattress support than a traditional box spring or platform bed system. Headboard legs are fitted with countersunk adjustable levelers for use on uneven floors. Mostly tool-free assembly process uses rubber clips and thoughtful design to simplify the procedure. Metal side and center rail brackets make for easy assembly, reassembly and long-term durability. Elegant 5 foot tall scroll-style headboard is accented with 2 rows of piping trim pulled tightly to create depth and accentuate gently rounded top profile. Linen-like upholstery material is a soft, tightly woven, piece-dyed fabric made from 100-percent polyester which is more stain resistant than cotton and linen; knitted backing gives a soft hand and increased durability; ivory color is a neutral shade; varying thread diameters create a textured surface. Also available as a headboard-only for use with metal bed frames. Covered by a 1-year manufacturer's warranty. Product Dimensions: 89-Inch by 83-Inch by 60-Inch. Weighs 138-pounds. Indulgent tufting and cushioning surround you in luxury with the Geneva upholstered bed collection from Modus. Each model is wrapped from head to toe in a textural linen fabric for a tailored finish. With styles ranging from sleek and modern to lavishly hand tufted, the Geneva collection features elegant details like piped edges. Large headboards let you pile pillows high or present a clean, neutral expanse. Tapered block feet are hand-finished in an Espresso tone. Headboards feature built-in levelers and are designed to fit standard metal frames. Headboards will attach to most non-standard frames with a Modi-plate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K7gIL4PCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modus Furniture","source_asin":"B00M1P2AYQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-333943","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00M1P2AYQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00M1P2AYQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
